<title>UK: Bankers Trust warrants on Taiwan financial basket.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust warrants on Taiwan financial basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc says it has issued five million American-style call warrants, on a Taiwan financial basket comprising China Development Corp, International Commercial Bank of China, Fuh Hwa Securities, China Life Insurance and China Trust Commercial Bank.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one unit of the basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    338.00 NTD		PREMIUM	13.42 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     $1.65		     GEARING	7.45 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 04.DEC.96-19.AUG.97   PAYDATE	03.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 5000</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
